{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Based on your reference, I understand the flow:
    
    * **Filter Group 1:** Services (Build, Migrate, Marketing, Shopify Ongoing Support)
    * **Filter Group 2:** Industries (Fashion, Coffee, Cosmetics, Electronics, etc.)
    * **Case Study Grid:** Dynamically filters based on the selected Service + Industry.
    * **Each card:** Website preview image, project name, short description, technology stack icons, and CTA.
    
    Since you're using **Shopify AI**, here's a detailed prompt that should generate a polished, premium section.
    
    ---
    
    # Shopify AI Prompt
    
    Create a premium **"Case Studies"** section for a Shopify agency website with a modern **black luxury theme** inspired by Linear, Vercel, Apple Developer, Framer and Stripe.
    
    The entire section should be fully customizable from the Shopify Theme Editor.
    
    ## Overall Design
    
    * Background: #080808
    * Secondary Surface: #111111
    * Card Background: #161616
    * Border: rgba(255,255,255,0.08)
    * Heading Color: #FFFFFF
    * Secondary Text: #A1A1AA
    * Accent Color: #FFFFFF
    * Border Radius: 20px
    * Large spacing with premium typography
    * Smooth hover animations
    * Fully responsive
    
    ---
    
    ## Section Header
    
    Large heading
    
    **CASE STUDIES**
    
    Below the heading add a short description
    
    "Explore some of the Shopify experiences we've designed, developed and optimized across multiple industries."
    
    ---
    
    # Filter Panel
    
    Create two independent filter groups.
    
    Both should support multiple options.
    
    Use pill buttons.
    
    Inactive
    
    * Background #1A1A1A
    * Text #BDBDBD
    
    Active
    
    * White background
    * Black text
    * Slight shadow
    * Smooth transition
    
    ---
    
    ## Filter Group 1
    
    Title
    
    Services
    
    Filter Pills
    
    * Build
    * Migrate
    * Marketing
    * Shopify Ongoing Support
    
    ---
    
    ## Filter Group 2
    
    Title
    
    Industries
    
    Pills
    
    * Women's Boutique
    * Clothing
    * Cosmetics
    * Sports
    * Coffee
    * Food & Nutrition
    * Home Decor
    * Furniture
    * Jewelry
    * Electronics
    * Subscription
    * Automotive
    * Pet Store
    * Print On Demand
    
    Allow merchants to add unlimited filters from Theme Editor.
    
    ---
    
    # Filtering Logic
    
    Each Case Study should support assigning
    
    * Multiple Services
    * Multiple Industries
    
    Display only matching case studies.
    
    If only one filter group is selected, filter accordingly.
    
    If both are selected, show matching items only.
    
    Include an "All" option.
    
    Filtering must happen instantly with no page refresh.
    
    Use smooth fade animation.
    
    ---
    
    # Case Study Grid
    
    Desktop
    
    3 Cards per row
    
    Tablet
    
    2 Cards
    
    Mobile
    
    1 Card
    
    Large spacing between cards.
    
    ---
    
    # Case Study Card
    
    Premium floating card.
    
    Background
    
    #141414
    
    Border
    
    1px rgba(255,255,255,.08)
    
    Radius
    
    20px
    
    Overflow hidden.
    
    Soft shadow.
    
    Hover
    
    Lift card upward
    
    Scale image slightly
    
    Border becomes brighter
    
    Shadow increases
    
    Transition 300ms
    
    Cursor pointer.
    
    ---
    
    ## Website Header Preview
    
    At the top of every card display a screenshot of the website homepage.
    
    Use the screenshot exactly as uploaded by the merchant.
    
    Image
    
    * Full Width
    * 16:9 Ratio
    * Cover
    * Rounded top corners
    
    On hover
    
    Image zoom 105%
    
    ---
    
    ## Project Name
    
    Large Bold
    
    Example
    
    TEVEO
    
    MESTIZA NEW YORK
    
    DANISH ENDURANCE
    
    Font Size
    
    24px
    
    Weight
    
    700
    
    White
    
    ---
    
    ## Short Description
    
    Maximum
    
    2 lines
    
    Examples
    
    "Performance-driven Shopify experience for a premium fitness apparel brand."
    
    "Luxury fashion storefront focused on storytelling and conversion."
    
    Color
    
    #B5B5B5
    
    Font
    
    16px
    
    ---
    
    ## Technology Stack
    
    Below description show icons representing technologies used.
    
    Display icons horizontally.
    
    Examples
    
    🟢 Shopify
    
    🟟 Shopify Plus
    
    🟢 Hydrogen
    
    🟢 Liquid
    
    🟢 Meta Ads
    
    🟢 Klaviyo
    
    🟢 Recharge
    
    🟢 Judge.me
    
    🟢 Yotpo
    
    🟢 GA4
    
    🟢 CRO
    
    🟢 SEO
    
    Use official SVG logos wherever possible.
    
    Icons inside rounded containers.
    
    Hover
    
    Small tooltip
    
    Example
    
    "Shopify Plus"
    
    Allow merchant to add/remove icons per project.
    
    ---
    
    ## Tags
    
    Below technologies add small badges.
    
    Examples
    
    Migration
    
    Design
    
    Development
    
    Optimization
    
    Retention
    
    Subscriptions
    
    SEO
    
    Apps
    
    Black pill
    
    White text
    
    ---
    
    ## Bottom CTA
    
    Add
    
    View Case Study →
    
    Button
    
    White
    
    Text Black
    
    Rounded
    
    Hover
    
    Invert colors
    
    ---
    
    # Theme Editor Settings
    
    Merchant should be able to add unlimited Case Studies.
    
    Each Case Study should have:
    
    * Project Name
    * Short Description
    * Website Screenshot
    * Website URL
    * Client Logo (optional)
    * Services (multi-select)
    * Industries (multi-select)
    * Technology Icons
    * Tags
    * CTA Text
    * CTA URL
    
    Merchant should also be able to reorder projects.
    
    ---
    
    # Animations
    
    Entire section fades upward.
    
    Cards stagger into view.
    
    Filter pills animate smoothly.
    
    Cards animate when filtering.
    
    Images zoom on hover.
    
    Buttons animate.
    
    No flashy effects.
    
    Everything should feel premium.
    
    ---
    
    # Performance
    
    * Native Shopify section
    * No external libraries
    * Lazy-load images
    * Responsive images (`image_picker`)
    * SVG icons
    * Minimal JavaScript
    * Fast filtering
    * Accessibility compliant (keyboard navigation and ARIA labels)
    
    ---
    
    ## Visual Inspiration
    
    The final design should feel like a premium Shopify agency portfolio with a clean, editorial aest
